# Binary assets of `ui-dist/fonts` that are staged by build.rs instead of being committed twice.
#
# Format: `<destination under ui-dist/> <canonical source under the repository root>`, one pair
# per line, no spaces inside a path. build.rs copies each source over a missing or different
# destination before `tauri::generate_context!()` embeds the `ui-dist` directory, so a clean
# clone embeds the same bytes as before without any staging command. The destinations are
# ignored by git (see .gitignore); the sources are the single canonical copies:
#   packages/ui/m3-fonts/fonts/web/   Google Sans Flex, Roboto Flex, Noto Sans JP, M PLUS 1 Code
#   crates/ui/bun/icons/material-symbols/   Material Symbols (the aphrody-bun icons module)
#   packages/ui/assets/{icons,images,sounds}/   @aphrody/assets (file-kind icons and sounds)
# tests/ui_dist_assets.rs fails when an entry is not staged or differs from its source.
